            "de": "Sahne, die Hälfte des Fetas, gehackte Kräuter und Zitronenschale einrühren. Sanft andicken lassen."
          },
          "timer_seconds": 300
        },
        {
          "id": "poach-eggs",
          "text": {
            "en": "Make eight hollows, crack in eggs, cover and poach until whites are set and yolks remain soft.",
